{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Mediterranean Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "A pungent and dense Mediterranean dish featuring cubed feta cheese, perfect for a date night, with a smoke-cold and low-carb-friendly twist.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "diet": [
    "low-carb",
